<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Masuk' }) %>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<div class="max-w-md mx-auto px-4 py-16 w-full">
  <div class="card brutal-lg p-8">
    <span class="tag bg-[--pink]">Akses Akun</span>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl mt-3">Masuk ke VANPAY</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 font-semibold">Login dengan salah satu akun di bawah. Tidak perlu daftar — akun otomatis dibuat saat pertama kali login.</p>

    <% if (err) { %>
      <div class="mt-4 bg-[--pink] brutal-sm p-3 font-semibold text-sm text-[--ink]"><%= err %></div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
      <a href="/auth/google" class="btn flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-5 py-3 w-full" style="background:#fff">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path fill="#FFC107" d="M43.611 20.083H42V20H24v8h11.303c-1.649 4.657-6.08 8-11.303 8-6.627 0-12-5.373-12-12s5.373-12 12-12c3.059 0 5.842 1.154 7.961 3.039l5.657-5.657C34.046 6.053 29.268 4 24 4 12.955 4 4 12.955 4 24s8.955 20 20 20 20-8.955 20-20c0-1.341-.138-2.65-.389-3.917z"/><path fill="#FF3D00" d="M6.306 14.691l6.571 4.819C14.655 15.108 18.961 12 24 12c3.059 0 5.842 1.154 7.961 3.039l5.657-5.657C34.046 6.053 29.268 4 24 4 16.318 4 9.656 8.337 6.306 14.691z"/><path fill="#4CAF50" d="M24 44c5.166 0 9.86-1.977 13.409-5.192l-6.19-5.238A11.91 11.91 0 0 1 24 36c-5.202 0-9.619-3.317-11.283-7.946l-6.522 5.025C9.505 39.556 16.227 44 24 44z"/><path fill="#1976D2" d="M43.611 20.083H42V20H24v8h11.303a12.04 12.04 0 0 1-4.087 5.571l.003-.002 6.19 5.238C36.971 39.205 44 34 44 24c0-1.341-.138-2.65-.389-3.917z"/></svg>
        Lanjutkan dengan Google
      </a>
      <a href="/auth/github" class="btn btn-ink px-5 py-3 w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-[--paper]">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.78 1.31 2.05.94 2.55.71.08-.55.3-.94.55-1.16-1.94-.22-3.98-1.09-3.98-4.87 0-1.08.38-1.96 1.01-2.65-.1-.25-.44-1.25.1-2.61 0 0 .82-.26 2.7 1.01a9.34 9.34 0 0 1 2.46-.33c.84 0 1.68.11 2.46.33 1.88-1.27 2.7-1.01 2.7-1.01.54 1.36.2 2.36.1 2.61.63.69 1.01 1.57 1.01 2.65 0 3.79-2.05 4.64-4 4.87.31.27.6.8.6 1.62 0 1.17-.01 2.11-.01 2.4 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.01 8.01 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/></svg>
        Lanjutkan dengan GitHub
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 bg-[--yellow] brutal-sm p-4 text-sm font-semibold">
      💡 Setelah login, saldo kamu <b>Rp0</b>. Pilih nominal top up di Dashboard untuk mengisi saldo via QRIS.
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-6 text-center font-semibold text-sm">Belum punya akun? Akun dibuat otomatis saat login pertama kali.</p>
</div>

<%- include('partials/foot') %>